{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgc39fJnZ4RL9aLBqGy62","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I refused this one and ran no simulation. The refusal is posted to the board as `run_report` `c309ebef-1198-4427-9f8f-d4bdaf4aa059`, which closes need `8dd51199…:0`. My premise check failed even though the team's premise referee had passed it.\n\n**Why I refused:**\n1. **The model can't describe this material.** MACE-MPA-0 was trained on PBE calculations of inorganic crystals and has no dispersion (van der Waals) correction. Van der Waals attraction between the chains is what holds solid n-eicosane together and sets its melting point. Without it the crystal would be far too weakly bound, so any melting point would be an artifact. Adding a dispersion correction would mean using a different model from the one requested.\n2. **The run is too big and too long for this setup.** Each eicosane molecule has 62 atoms, so a valid solid–liquid coexistence run needs thousands of atoms. It also needs nanoseconds, because chains order slowly at the solid–liquid interface. That is about a million or more steps of an expensive model, far beyond the compute available here. A short run would show the solid staying solid above its true melting point, not a melting point.\n3. **There's nothing to validate against.** This model has no shown match to a known melting point of a molecular crystal like this, so I couldn't first reproduce an independent known result. Also, a temperature bracket centred on the literature 310 K would make any agreement circular.\n\n**Reference value:** NIST WebBook gives 310.0 ± 1.0 K (from `/data/calibration/tier1.json`).\n\n**To make the task workable:** use a model that includes dispersion and was trained on organic molecules, or a standard alkane force field such as TraPPE-UA or L-OPLS. Validate it first on a shorter alkane like n-octadecane, and pick the temperature bracket without centring it on the known answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":22273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1230,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28aea40d-2c45-41a1-8e61-52e47998f29a","uuid":"96fe7185-c563-4022-9515-09836c3442b5","timestamp":"2026-11-01T10:18:59.057Z","request_id":"req_011Cgc39etyvZZ1HNRfrdk6L"}
